f, not a target.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this characterization of the deadline identically.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this, with 'it' referring to the 18th cut-off mentioned in the preceding sentence.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this exception to the fixed deadline identically.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submit one file per team. The file must list every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states these submission requirements in consecutive sentences.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this requirement identically.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this rule identically.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and are applied to the following month.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A contains this statement, with the claim drawn from its first part.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and are applied to the following month.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A explicitly states that post-cut-off corrections are applied to the following month.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team and keep the file.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this guidance; the claim rephrases it using passive voice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Do not send totals in the body of an email.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states this prohibition; the claim rephrases it with a modal verb.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by internal post, to arrive no later than the cut-off.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B states this option identically.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":18161,"type":"result","duration_ms":25872,"uuid":"25b07888-e22d-4309-b9c8-a47c730b3342","ttft_stream_ms":916,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":917,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
